@cevich no longer maintains the repo.

As discussed internally and per https://github.com/podman-container-tools/image_build/pull/58 @timcoding1988 offered to maintain it. But that needs a full CI rework since cirrus got shut down.

And then the other point being that these images are just based on fedora packages so far, so the latest version will not be published until f45 is there regardless.
